    "name": "sentry-fix-stack-traces",
    "title": {
      "zh-CN": "sentry-fix-stack-traces（Sentry）",
      "zh-TW": "sentry-fix-stack-traces（Sentry）",
      "en": "sentry-fix-stack-traces (Sentry)"
    },
    "summary": {
      "zh-CN": "让 Sentry 堆栈可读：为 JavaScript/TypeScript 上传 source map，或为原生与移动端上传调试文件（dSYM、ProGuard/R8、NDK 符号、Dart 混淆映射、.NET PDB）；当堆栈帧显示压缩名、打包路径、十六进制地址或「unknown」时使用。",
      "zh-TW": "讓 Sentry 堆疊可讀：為 JavaScript/TypeScript 上傳 source map，或為原生與行動端上傳除錯檔案（dSYM、ProGuard/R8、NDK 符號、Dart 混淆對應、.NET PDB）；當堆疊框顯示壓縮名、打包路徑、十六進位位址或「unknown」時使用。",
      "en": "Make Sentry stack traces readable — upload source maps for JavaScript/TypeScript, or debug files for native and mobile (dSYM, ProGuard/R8, NDK symbols, Dart obfuscation maps, .NET PDBs). Use when frames in Sentry show minified names, bundled paths, hex addresses, \"unknown\", or method names with no file/line, instead of your original source."
    }
  },
